  "scope": "Trace the ordinary ConversationRoot Codex pane ViewParams producer and check known navigation/title candidates. No app, docs, tests, runtime or shared REA target mutations.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "TITLE539-01",
      "status": "verified-static",
      "conclusion": "ConversationRootCodexPane has viewModel, openMenu, didReturnToTaskList and Environment<CodexScreenLayout> fields. Its View.body witness53db3c tails53dab8. It constructs ViewParams with the supplied openMenu, environment-derived layout, nil dismiss, nil onTranscriptScrollViewResolved and supplied didReturnToTaskList.",
      "offsets": [
        "descriptor0x95659e4 accessor0x66125c static metadata0xa43d828",
        "conformance0x7d0b360 View.body witness0x53db3c ->0x53dab8",
        "0x53dadc..0x53db00 copies openMenu into ViewParams base sp+0x10",
        "0x53daf4 ->0x4ff2b8 reads Environment<CodexScreenLayout> and0x53db04 stores layout at Params+0x10",
        "0x53db08 ->0x6fd044 zeroes q0 and stores at sp+0x28 = Params.dismiss+0x18",
        "0x53db0c zero q0 at sp+0x38 = Params.onTranscript+0x28",
        "0x53daf8 and0x53db10 copy didReturnToTaskList to sp+0x48 = Params+0x38",
        "0x53db1c passes Params pointer sp+0x10 then0x53db24 invokes0x7656724"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "The concrete runtime layout value is inherited. This producer does not establish that every device/entry uses standard layout."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TITLE539-02",
      "status": "verified-static-with-dynamic-dispatch-limit",
      "conclusion": "The CodexScreenTemplate registration supplies Container builder3a62b8 through closure3d09b4. That builder copies its ViewParams input to CodexScreenContainer at+8, preserving the nil dismiss and other fields from the supplied value. The shared typed template consumer is BaseAnyViewModel<CodexScreenTemplate,AnyView>.",
      "offsets": [
        "0x3a60fc registration passes template metadata0xa5c5b40 and closure0x3d09b4",
        "0x3d09b4 ->0x3a62b8",
        "0x3a62d4..0x3a62e8 loads Params chunks from inputx1",
        "0x3a6374..0x3a638c stores Params at Container+8 through+0x48",
        "0x7656724 ->0x7669fd8 dispatches stored view closure using metadata fieldoffset+0x70"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "The exact runtime BaseAnyViewModel instance and closure assignment selected by the ordinary PaneState.codex producer are not materialized in this static investigation. Template registration plus matching generic type constrains this edge but does not independently prove runtime closure identity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TITLE539-03",
      "status": "verified-static",
      "conclusion": "The ordinary ConversationRoot pane is a distinct entry family from CalpicoRoom presentation. PaneState metadata case codex has exactly the BaseAnyViewModel<CodexScreenTemplate,AnyView> type used by ConversationRootCodexPane. Separate CalpicoRoom.Presentation typerefs wrap the same template with WeakBox. Their dismissal/layout values cannot be substituted for the ordinary pane.",
      "offsets": [
        "PaneState descriptor0x9565830 case index6 codex type0x8c21d82",
        "ConversationRootCodexPane.viewModel type0x8c21d82",
        "CalpicoRoom.Presentation template type records0x8f5e2de/0x8f5e31c/0x8f5e42e/0x8f5e478"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "Case identity and matching type do not finish the outer root switch callback. That callback still needs binding to the concrete CodexPane construction."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TITLE539-04",
      "status": "partial",
      "conclusion": "ConversationRootView uses MeasurableBodyView with concrete body5253a0 through witness5322f0. The ordinary pane body, captured root body, split body and known lower navigation parents show no direct BL import for toolbarRole or ToolbarRole.editor in the scoped inventory. Known CodexContentView root branch still applies empty navigationTitle and inline display mode. No source-proven selected-thread title placement override was found.",
      "offsets": [
        "local conformance0x7d06d40 protocolMeasurableBodyView0x9723800 witnessslot0xad525c0 ->0x5322f0 ->0x5253a0",
        "root View.body0x5322f4 tails generic measurable wrapper0x50d39ec",
        "root empty navigationTitle0x305ca4 and inline display0x305cec",
        "thread title availability0x1a3007c..0x1a30094 retained principal on iOS26+"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "The BL inventory excludes indirect callbacks and generic modifier payloads. This is not a global absence claim.",
        "No UINavigationBar appearance/titleView override or .toolbarRole(.editor) has been bound to this entry.",
        "The supplied newer screenshot remains version-unbound."
      ]
    }
  ],
